			"accept": ["{price}? Oh, yes, lovely, thank you. Is that okay? It is okay.", "Okay! {price}! I did a deal!", "Um, yes. {price}. Should I have said no? No. Yes. Deal.", "{price}, great, sorry, thank you, sorry."],
			"reject": ["Oh, um, my sister said not to go under the sticker for that one. Sorry.", "I'm, um, I'm going to say no. Is that allowed? I'm saying no.", "Sorry! That one's actually quite new. Sorry.", "Oh no, I don't think I can. My mum would be upset."],
